    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "While-Schleifen stoppen",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne, wie du eine Variable verwendest, um eine while-Schleife zu stoppen",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17314,
        "title": "While-Schleifen unterbrechen",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisher haben wir gelernt, wie man eine while-Schleife erstellt, jetzt konzentrieren wir uns darauf, wie man sie davon abhält, unendlich zu schleifen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um eine Schleife zu stoppen, beginnen wir damit, eine Variable außerhalb der Schleife zu erstellen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>let</code>, gefolgt von <code>gameRunning</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146689,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir verwenden die Variable in der Bedingung, um zu entscheiden, ob die Schleife ihren Codeblock ausführen soll oder nicht. Zum Beispiel, <code>(gameRunning === true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>gameRunning</code>, gefolgt von <code>===</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Innerhalb des Codeblocks stoppen wir die Schleife, indem wir <code>gameRunning</code> auf <code>false</code> setzen, sodass die Bedingung <code>false</code> zurückgibt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"107\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Schleife führt ihren gesamten Codeblock aus, weil <code>gameRunning</code> zunächst <code>true</code> ist, aber sie wird nicht erneut ausgeführt, wenn wir <code>gameRunning</code> auf <code>false</code> setzen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>false</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Woher wissen wir, dass diese Schleife läuft und nie aufhört, ihren Codeblock zu wiederholen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelLoaded = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es gibt keine Variable in der Bedingung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Diese Schleife wird nicht ausgeführt, da die Bedingung <code>false</code> ist</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es gibt keine Variable in der Bedingung.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Woher wissen wir, dass die <code>while</code>-Schleife ihren Codeblock überspringt?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Wert von <code>isPaused</code> ist <code>false</code>, aber die Bedingung überprüft, ob er <code>true</code> ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Wert von <code>isPaused</code> ist <code>false</code> und die Bedingung überprüft, ob er <code>false</code> ist</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Wert von <code>isPaused</code> ist <code>false</code>, aber die Bedingung überprüft, ob er <code>true</code> ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Woher wissen wir, dass diese Schleife stoppt?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update player and enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die <code>gameRunning</code> Variable wird innerhalb des Codeblocks auf <code>false</code> aktualisiert</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wir wissen nicht, ob die Schleife stoppt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die <code>gameRunning</code> Variable wird innerhalb des Codeblocks auf <code>false</code> aktualisiert.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level start!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dieser Code zeigt nichts in der Konsole an</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level start!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146696,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um die Variable in der Bedingung der while-Schleife zu verwenden, erstelle sie außerhalb des Codeblocks.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>let</code>, gefolgt von <code>gameRunning</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überspringe die Schleife, indem du die <code>isPaused</code>-Variable innerhalb der Bedingung verwendest.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>isPaused</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Innerhalb des Codeblocks beende die Schleife, nachdem der Codeblock ausgeführt wurde, indem du <code>gameRunning</code> auf <code>false</code> setzt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>gameRunning</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>false</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Innerhalb des Codeblocks stoppe die Schleife, nachdem ihr Codeblock ausgeführt wurde, indem du <code>gameRunning</code> auf <code>false</code> setzt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>false</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}